            <h1>Purpose:</h1>
            <p>I'm a cybersecurity professional with hands-on experience applying RMF and managing NIST 800-53 controls
                to support secure, compliant systems. I’ve worked across classified and unclassified networks, helping
                teams identify risks, strengthen defenses, and meet mission goals without overcomplicating the process.
                I take pride in making security practical, working with both technical and non-technical teams to build
                solutions that actually stick. I'm looking for a role where I can keep growing while protecting systems
                that matter.</p>
            <h1>Professional Philosophy:</h2>
                <p>My goal is to make security feel like a natural part of how people work, not something that gets in
                    the way. I focus on creating real solutions that protect what matters and are easy for teams to
                    understand and use. I believe in listening first, solving problems with care, and building trust
                    through clear communication and follow-through. I stay curious, keep learning, and try to make
                    security better every day, for everyone it touches.</p>
